"Reply STOP to opt out of SMS messages from XTimers. After you send STOP,\n      XTimers will stop sending SMS messages to that phone number\n      unless you opt in again." = "XTimers SMS ରୁ ବାହାରିବାକୁ STOP ଉତ୍ତର ଦିଅନ୍ତୁ। STOP ପରେ ପୁନଃ ଅପ୍ଟ-ଇନ୍ ନକରିବା ପର୍ଯ୍ୟନ୍ତ XTimers ସେହି ନମ୍ବରକୁ SMS ପଠାଇବ ନାହିଁ।";
